          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is GreenWise plant protein vegan?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Its label lists only plant ingredients, organic pea protein isolate and organic rice protein with a pea and coconut creamer, coconut oil and gums, and it carries no milk allergen statement on the record we read. Check the label on your tub for a vegan claim if that certification matters to you."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does Publix put protein powder on BOGO?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Publix runs Buy One Get One Free promotions across many categories, and protein and nutrition products appear in them from time to time. When your powder is in the BOGO ad, cost per 25 g of protein halves, which is usually the cheapest it will be at Publix. Check the weekly ad in the Publix app."
