                  Yes. Publix's GreenWise brand sells a whey protein in vanilla and chocolate, in a large tub of about 32 servings and a small vanilla tub of about 17, and a GreenWise Organic Plant Protein in vanilla and chocolate. The whey gives 15 g of protein per scoop and the plant powder 21 g, per their labels.
                </p>
